    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "バンブーメモリー",
            "enName": "Bamboo Memory",
            "jpText": "――目覚まし時計を、首に下げて寝る！\r\nこれなら寝坊しないっス！",
            "enText": "You could try hanging your alarm clock \naround your neck before bed. That way \nyou'll never oversleep!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 6748978714941854518,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "は？　やんないし。\r\nカウベルかっての。",
            "enText": "Huh? Not a chance. It'll look like a cowbell.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 8923609395931429153,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "そうですよ、バンブーさん！\r\nもっと大きな、柱時計にしましょう！",
            "enText": "She has a point, Bamboo! I think what she \nreally needs is a big grandfather clock!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -3528138028345305569,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "……いや、あのさ。\r\nガチでそういうのいいって。",
            "enText": "…Yeah, no. I really don't need any of these.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 6928583390417248056,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "仕事疲れで朝弱いのも、\r\n練習に響いてんのも……アタシの問題だし。",
            "enText": "I know I suck at mornings 'cause of work, \nand I let it affect practice… but that's a me \nproblem.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -2516216241094176972,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "バンブーメモリー",
            "enName": "Bamboo Memory",
            "jpText": "いえ！　そういうわけにはいかないっス！\r\n風紀委員長で、同室ですし！",
            "enText": "Nonsense! What kind of disciplinary \ncommittee chair and roommate would \nI be if I didn't try to help!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 2874561278448776951,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "学級委員長として、見過ごせないですしッ！",
            "enText": "And I cannot overlook this as class rep!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -2999548178725702288,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "友だちじゃないっスか！\r\n友だちじゃないですか！",
            "enText": "And aren't we all friends?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 7267893246714977191,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "あー……ったく。\r\n……はぁー。",
            "enText": "Aah… Geez. <i>Sigh</i>…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -8938179868210123208,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "……アラーム爆音にする。で、勘弁して？",
            "enText": "I'll just turn the alarm volume \nall the way up, 'kay?",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 3324473025496905320,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
